cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Texas Weather Explorer"
abstract: >-
  A farmer-facing website showing 30 years of daily weather history for any
  point in Texas, with a visible choice of data source, season-to-date
  tracking against the long-term range, analog-year matching, county crop
  yields, satellite water use, and a three-tier forecast.
